&_nc_oc=AdrnnqczAtACgl8ee-wmjTTll8sfM7w29v1WCcNJ3ZfvPd1hldHzjyxpBFhPZgbfvps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8gR3dzcCkbqhnN48BNMHezqQTECMU9_8UxFrF6UvVyFg&oe=6A26DCBE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sEbyCjqD6CYQ7kNvwE7V7Uv&_nc_oc=AdoPQN_etXGBZno7kM7aHJPBbZsjOYy5X3uMGGS-arydECz9vnTizicbPHfUMw0Y_gw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_fLlBgR62k27K2Y3hCJ_115vnf1VCVyLV949QxZHGBgQ&oe=6A26EDBC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-yFj1ggQmD0Q7kNvwGHxcP0&_nc_oc=Ado0BFSsHpjqCQPAE-Y69oNfri0iPs5oI1N-mXCkPnmAOIfas0cpq8iNKRMFh-4r490&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_P7cwHltgRvZRAJhnN8jmyPvdII7cNYgquQfYxDoj7qA&oe=6A26D407"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b7AR3B4_I6QQ7kNvwEooLXA&_nc_oc=Adp3xtoM4nTufrM68pL8Fdsho4IOY54zSbL2fz0WP9knDsxakxxuLpPxAMgMVmmCsnw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_MoGZsz-ObcgodKpT4zyj5FRwkeJrxGtnTVL-37LskJg&oe=6A26BFD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6waxzZ2_POAQ7kNvwFWjmI_&_nc_oc=AdoZ8nHkO0rnhDFk_pNxVRMONCRkT6BqflAghyAABqvBrc2eCObmHxGhgQKxSb3pKY4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8o2HfFI1MNg1w5nzO4AwSmCtDKS9QwX0rcsb65j5PPwQ&oe=6A26CC64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.